~ after_movement
Admin: Great job! You've got the hang of it.
Admin: Do you want to know the mechanism of the game?
- I would love to know
	Admin: The objective is....
	Admin: You must meet the electricity quota targets before the reactor becomes increasingly unstable.
	Admin: The systems maintaining the reactor will also become increasingly fragile and degrade over time while the reactor is running.
	Admin: We have laser, extractor, coolant, and vent.
	Admin: Laser is a tool for adding temperature and pressure
	Admin: An extractor is a device used to extract power from a running reactor. 
	Admin: The higher the extraction level, the faster the quota is met and the higher the pressure required.
	Admin: Coolant to cool the reactor and vent to reduce the reactor pressure
	Admin: If in an urgent situation and the reactor starts to go out of control, there is an emergency system that will help stabilize/shut down the reactor.
- Nah, i got this!
=> END